# The highest version code Google Play has accepted for com.taffygo.browser.
# Format: `key=value`, `#` comments. Read by tools/github-release.d/prepare.py.
#
# `./tools/github-release prepare` refuses an APK or a bundle whose version code
# is not above this number (decision 0252, point 3). The APK a GitHub release
# carries comes from the same build as the bundle Play receives, and Play
# refuses a version code it has already accepted, so an artifact at or below
# this number cannot be the build Play will carry.
#
# Raise it by hand when Play accepts an upload, in the change that records the
# upload. `--min-version-code N` raises the bar for one run without editing
# this file.
#
# 797704204 is the code Chromium derives from 152.0.7977.42. The first upload
# to the internal track took it on 2026-09-11. The internal track then took
# 797704214, 797704224 and 797704234 on 2026-09-27, and 797704234 was sent
# for production review the same day.
play_accepted_version_code=797704234
